{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Retopology in Blender.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Retopology in Blender.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"retopology in blender retopology in blender","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Retopology in Blender.md","fileName":"Retopology in Blender.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Retopology in Blender","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-07 23:25\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Sculpting and Geometry Objects]] · [[Low-Poly Game Environment Art]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Sculpting and Geometry Objects","Low-Poly Game Environment Art","blenderfordummies4thedition.pdf","creatinggameenvironmentsinblender3d.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Retopology in Blender.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Retopology in Blender.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"retopology in blender retopology in blender","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Retopology in Blender.md","fileName":"Retopology in Blender.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Retopology in Blender","heading":"Retopology in Blender","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Retopology rebuilds a clean mesh over a dense or irregular sculpt. The sculpt supplies the form, while a new mesh uses more deliberate edge flow and a lower, more even component count.\n\nBlender's native workflow combines ordinary modeling tools with surface snapping. Afterward, important detail from the high-resolution sculpt can be reintroduced through modeling or baked textures.\n\nFor game assets, retopology separates the mesh used to author fine form from the lower-complexity mesh used at runtime. The appropriate reduction is relative to target hardware, viewing distance, deformation needs, and the asset's importance within the environment.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Sculpting and Geometry Objects","Low-Poly Game Environment Art","blenderfordummies4thedition.pdf","creatinggameenvironmentsinblender3d.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Retopology in Blender.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Retopology in Blender.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"retopology in blender retopology in blender","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Retopology in Blender.md","fileName":"Retopology in Blender.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Retopology in Blender","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[blenderfordummies4thedition.pdf]]\n\n[[creatinggameenvironmentsinblender3d.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Sculpting and Geometry Objects","Low-Poly Game Environment Art","blenderfordummies4thedition.pdf","creatinggameenvironmentsinblender3d.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}